+---
+id: task-002-implement-json-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Patch"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch for JSON documents.
+
+Export `applyPatch(document, patch)` from `src/index.ts`. It must apply add, remove,
+replace, move, copy and test operations without mutating the input document, return a
+new result, and reject invalid patches or failed operations. Add focused tests for all
+operations and their important failure cases, and document the public API.
